{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "cfp4xepag4n9g0t5", "title": "100.基于PyTorch微调T5模型", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u9b4b2fbe\" id=\"u9b4b2fbe\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u35e79420\" id=\"u35e79420\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4934ba46\" id=\"u4934ba46\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F2424104%2F1745804258180-f8ab4d7c-4672-4daf-a2d8-a5ad54cd2534.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pytorch-train.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A26724%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u15c4c85e-9b88-4896-859e-081b9280734%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6afe4f0f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubd00ce8d\" id=\"ubd00ce8d\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9fb7d65d\" id=\"u9fb7d65d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8e25b508\" id=\"u8e25b508\"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"NkUfM\" id=\"NkUfM\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13ee8d1c\" id=\"u13ee8d1c\">前言</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u9987801c\" id=\"u9987801c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u537002ec\" id=\"u537002ec\">本次分享如何在</span><a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/main/examples/pytorch/summarization\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ubd6b880e\" id=\"ubd6b880e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u321c96c6\" id=\"u321c96c6\">PyTorch</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u53d4267c\" id=\"u53d4267c\">和中运行示例摘要训练脚本</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"PbZnB\" id=\"PbZnB\"><span data-lake-id=\"u30c95d56\" id=\"u30c95d56\">设置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ufb6ab558\" id=\"ufb6ab558\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e373fca\" id=\"u5e373fca\">要成功运行示例脚本的最新版本，您必须在新虚拟环境中</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaeca3839\" id=\"uaeca3839\">从源代码安装 </span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0db943c9\" id=\"u0db943c9\">🤗</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc790c1d9\" id=\"uc790c1d9\"> Transformers</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5ab4717c\" id=\"u5ab4717c\">：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22git%20clone%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%5Cncd%20transformers%5Cnpip%20install%20.%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zQn84%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4c0df101\" id=\"u4c0df101\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc2fba297\" id=\"uc2fba297\">然后切换您clone的 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u15df2b4f\" id=\"u15df2b4f\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u05e7f642\" id=\"u05e7f642\"> Transformers 仓到特定的版本，例如v3.5.1：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22git%20checkout%20tags%2Fv3.5.1%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rY4fv%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u73d0c2f0\" id=\"u73d0c2f0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe483c2a\" id=\"ufe483c2a\">在安装了正确的库版本后，进入您选择的版本的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u32a58b48\" id=\"u32a58b48\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc8dbab4\" id=\"ucc8dbab4\">example</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u250c8752\" id=\"u250c8752\">文件夹并安装例子要求的环境：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20-r%20requirements.txt%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XDW8v%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"YSR1y\" id=\"YSR1y\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0051bde7\" id=\"u0051bde7\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">运行脚本</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u086d6b38\" id=\"u086d6b38\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube9172a4\" id=\"ube9172a4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">示例脚本从</span><span data-lake-id=\"u39ecb790\" id=\"u39ecb790\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5627f9f6\" id=\"u5627f9f6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"> </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/datasets/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7a1976c2\" id=\"u7a1976c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4c23e63\" id=\"uc4c23e63\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">Datasets</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ubc6d1841\" id=\"ubc6d1841\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">库下载并预处理数据集。然后，脚本通过</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main_classes/trainer\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6e9baa10\" id=\"u6e9baa10\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43a8681b\" id=\"u43a8681b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">Trainer</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uf2b2063e\" id=\"uf2b2063e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用支持摘要任务的架构对数据集进行微调。以下示例展示了如何在</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/cnn_dailymail\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uef204519\" id=\"uef204519\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c477945\" id=\"u9c477945\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">CNN/DailyMail</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uac96addc\" id=\"uac96addc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">数据集上微调</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/google-t5/t5-small\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf333fa2a\" id=\"uf333fa2a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74aa4895\" id=\"u74aa4895\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">T5-small</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u300a9757\" id=\"u300a9757\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。由于T5模型的训练方式，它需要一个额外的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u57bb211f\" id=\"u57bb211f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13a178c7\" id=\"u13a178c7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">source_prefix</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udc6c4edd\" id=\"udc6c4edd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">参数。这个提示让T5知道这是一个摘要任务。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20examples%2Fpytorch%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--overwrite_output_dir%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--predict_with_generate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M6Ve7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u6fb56d8a\" id=\"u6fb56d8a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueae711bb\" id=\"ueae711bb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">示例脚本从 </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc6ae5884\" id=\"uc6ae5884\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1ac5f6e2\" id=\"u1ac5f6e2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"> </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/datasets/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"udc69eb1c\" id=\"udc69eb1c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue64270ee\" id=\"ue64270ee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">Datasets</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u3d9c7b05\" id=\"u3d9c7b05\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u9533db58\" id=\"u9533db58\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">库下载并预处理数据集。然后，脚本使用 Keras 在支持摘要的架构上微调数据集。以下示例展示了如何在</span><span data-lake-id=\"uba147a23\" id=\"uba147a23\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"> </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/cnn_dailymail\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0090f86c\" id=\"u0090f86c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucbf08e7d\" id=\"ucbf08e7d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">CNN/DailyMail</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7b194524\" id=\"u7b194524\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u22acc7f9\" id=\"u22acc7f9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">数据集上微调</span><span data-lake-id=\"u71b294fe\" id=\"u71b294fe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"> </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/google-t5/t5-small\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uaea46b60\" id=\"uaea46b60\"><span data-lake-id=\"u806a7fca\" id=\"u806a7fca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">T5-small</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6ce90295\" id=\"u6ce90295\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。T5 模型由于训练方式需要额外的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5e9daf04\" id=\"u5e9daf04\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u131a61ef\" id=\"u131a61ef\"><span data-lake-id=\"uff8e6133\" id=\"uff8e6133\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">source_prefix</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7544ac07\" id=\"u7544ac07\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc0ca03b6\" id=\"uc0ca03b6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">参数。这个提示让 T5 知道这是一个摘要任务。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20examples%2Ftensorflow%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%20%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%208%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%2016%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--num_train_epochs%203%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d7o1t%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"BWpWV\" id=\"BWpWV\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43a12feb\" id=\"u43a12feb\">分布式训练和混合精度</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u6ddb7b61\" id=\"u6ddb7b61\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main_classes/trainer\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2d691d7d\" id=\"u2d691d7d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u735cff00\" id=\"u735cff00\">Trainer</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uefd49d48\" id=\"uefd49d48\"> 支持分布式训练和混合精度，这意味着你也可以在脚本中使用它。要启用这两个功能，可以做如下设置：</span></p><ul list=\"u94b23a3f\"><li fid=\"u77acb04d\" data-lake-id=\"u69f6e51e\" id=\"u69f6e51e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8e677ab\" id=\"ud8e677ab\">添加 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u37511c07\" id=\"u37511c07\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e4e76d5\" id=\"u7e4e76d5\">fp16</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u472b0d5b\" id=\"u472b0d5b\"> 参数以启用混合精度。</span></li><li fid=\"u77acb04d\" data-lake-id=\"u6d6ec256\" id=\"u6d6ec256\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1869ff60\" id=\"u1869ff60\">使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u558ce306\" id=\"u558ce306\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6bd4a70b\" id=\"u6bd4a70b\">nproc_per_node</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubfc61aa7\" id=\"ubfc61aa7\"> 参数设置使用的GPU数量。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u42676262\" id=\"u42676262\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22torchrun%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--nproc_per_node%208%20pytorch%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--fp16%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--overwrite_output_dir%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--predict_with_generate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lC4kB%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2f6e994f\" id=\"u2f6e994f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64107966\" id=\"u64107966\">TensorFlow脚本使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"udb83671a\" id=\"udb83671a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a082469\" id=\"u3a082469\">MirroredStrategy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub011cad5\" id=\"ub011cad5\">进行分布式训练，您无需在训练脚本中添加任何其他参数。如果可用，TensorFlow脚本将默认使用多个GPU。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"iHSQ7\" id=\"iHSQ7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9efe31eb\" id=\"u9efe31eb\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">在TPU上运行脚本</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u8bb5c006\" id=\"u8bb5c006\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91601681\" id=\"u91601681\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">张量处理单元（TPUs）是专门设计用于加速性能的。PyTorch使用</span><a href=\"https://www.tensorflow.org/xla\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud5e94ee5\" id=\"ud5e94ee5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue49544d2\" id=\"ue49544d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">XLA</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u50da79e4\" id=\"u50da79e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">深度学习编译器支持TPU（更多细节请参见</span><a href=\"https://github.com/pytorch/xla/blob/master/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucaa488bc\" id=\"ucaa488bc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u957c2f42\" id=\"u957c2f42\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u24295158\" id=\"u24295158\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">）。要使用TPU，请启动</span><code data-lake-id=\"ucec0a03b\" id=\"ucec0a03b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1c13f50\" id=\"ua1c13f50\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">xla_spawn.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uada71273\" id=\"uada71273\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">脚本并使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u10f80fb9\" id=\"u10f80fb9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uecafd1ac\" id=\"uecafd1ac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">num_cores</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5d8b53ef\" id=\"u5d8b53ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">参数设置要使用的TPU核心数量。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20xla_spawn.py%20--num_cores%208%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20summarization%2Frun_summarization.py%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--overwrite_output_dir%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--predict_with_generate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zf5Xs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0866ae48\" id=\"u0866ae48\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17a7c1a7\" id=\"u17a7c1a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">张量处理单元（TPUs）是专门设计用于加速性能的。TensorFlow脚本使用</span><a href=\"https://www.tensorflow.org/guide/distributed_training#tpustrategy\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud1a1aad7\" id=\"ud1a1aad7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a2e603a\" id=\"u2a2e603a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--fgcolor-accent, var(--color-accent-fg))\">TPUStrategy</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u2ac6bf4f\" id=\"u2ac6bf4f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">在TPU上进行训练。要使用TPU，请将TPU资源的名称传递给</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud9b14d58\" id=\"ud9b14d58\"><span data-lake-id=\"u445fee0b\" id=\"u445fee0b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">tpu</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u16e0eebe\" id=\"u16e0eebe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">参数。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20run_summarization.py%20%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--tpu%20name_of_tpu_resource%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%208%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%2016%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--num_train_epochs%203%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MwTzO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"hpnor\" id=\"hpnor\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2d9d46b7\" id=\"u2d9d46b7\">基于</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub5772e1d\" id=\"ub5772e1d\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u03deb906\" id=\"u03deb906\"> Accelerate运行脚本</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u0c20b56f\" id=\"u0c20b56f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8eb93bbe\" id=\"u8eb93bbe\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u378c3be2\" id=\"u378c3be2\"> </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/accelerate\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc6153a05\" id=\"uc6153a05\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8e8ea0a\" id=\"ud8e8ea0a\">Accelerate</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1b55f0d1\" id=\"u1b55f0d1\"> 是一个仅支持 PyTorch 的库，它提供了一种统一的方法来在不同类型的设置（仅 CPU、多个 GPU、多个TPU）上训练模型，同时保持对 PyTorch 训练循环的完全可见性。如果你还没有安装 </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc914eb66\" id=\"uc914eb66\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u065c208b\" id=\"u065c208b\"> Accelerate，请确保你已经安装了它：</span></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u74afb85b\" id=\"u74afb85b\"><p data-lake-id=\"u6d9f94b9\" id=\"u6d9f94b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc16e67a7\" id=\"uc16e67a7\">注意：由于 Accelerate 正在快速发展，因此必须安装 git 版本的 accelerate 来运行脚本。</span></p></blockquote><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20git%2Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Faccelerate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jA0LI%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3812b7d2\" id=\"u3812b7d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf5b4688b\" id=\"uf5b4688b\">你需要使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5b2492dc\" id=\"u5b2492dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufee68ad8\" id=\"ufee68ad8\">run_summarization_no_trainer.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6d3ed9e3\" id=\"u6d3ed9e3\">脚本，而不是</span><code data-lake-id=\"ueb3dd008\" id=\"ueb3dd008\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b6a25a9\" id=\"u3b6a25a9\">run_summarization.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue1f48811\" id=\"ue1f48811\">脚本。</span><span data-lake-id=\"uc3e421c7\" id=\"uc3e421c7\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5341b7d1\" id=\"u5341b7d1\"> Accelerate支持的脚本需要在文件夹中有一个</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaa0b2b9c\" id=\"uaa0b2b9c\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd2dff0d\" id=\"udd2dff0d\">task_no_trainer.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub3c9f039\" id=\"ub3c9f039\">文件。首先运行以下命令以创建并保存配置文件：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22accelerate%20config%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LAqHL%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u25fa0307\" id=\"u25fa0307\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7a968f3\" id=\"ue7a968f3\">检测您的设置以确保配置正确：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22accelerate%20test%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DCR58%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubca25bcb\" id=\"ubca25bcb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue189bf5b\" id=\"ue189bf5b\">现在您可以开始训练模型了：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22accelerate%20launch%20run_summarization_no_trainer.py%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20~%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LZi3a%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"MDJcN\" id=\"MDJcN\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb35d3ed\" id=\"ufb35d3ed\">使用自定义数据集</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u765fff82\" id=\"u765fff82\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc75ce7c3\" id=\"uc75ce7c3\">摘要脚本支持自定义数据集，只要它们是CSV或JSON Line文件。当你使用自己的数据集时，需要指定一些额外的参数：</span></p><ul list=\"ua44ecd75\"><li fid=\"ue10722b4\" data-lake-id=\"ue1bd926a\" id=\"ue1bd926a\"><code data-lake-id=\"u5cc364d8\" id=\"u5cc364d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59eaeb76\" id=\"u59eaeb76\">train_file</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc1252510\" id=\"uc1252510\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ue1fff87b\" id=\"ue1fff87b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u394a3190\" id=\"u394a3190\">validation_file</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u775e3801\" id=\"u775e3801\"> 分别指定您的训练和验证文件的路径。</span></li><li fid=\"ue10722b4\" data-lake-id=\"u194ac96e\" id=\"u194ac96e\"><code data-lake-id=\"u87420ebc\" id=\"u87420ebc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1e4de8f\" id=\"uf1e4de8f\">text_column</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u86696a26\" id=\"u86696a26\"> 是输入要进行摘要的文本。</span></li><li fid=\"ue10722b4\" data-lake-id=\"udddfda45\" id=\"udddfda45\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2c1683f9\" id=\"u2c1683f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubca7d3ec\" id=\"ubca7d3ec\">summary_column</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5798cb40\" id=\"u5798cb40\"> 是目标输出的文本。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ud522a37d\" id=\"ud522a37d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f08b817\" id=\"u8f08b817\">使用自定义数据集的摘要脚本看起来是这样的：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20examples%2Fpytorch%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--train_file%20path_to_csv_or_jsonlines_file%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--validation_file%20path_to_csv_or_jsonlines_file%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--text_column%20text_column_name%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--summary_column%20summary_column_name%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--overwrite_output_dir%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--predict_with_generate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W3vE7%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"efV5n\" id=\"efV5n\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2d2a48be\" id=\"u2d2a48be\">测试脚本</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"udc0ccbaf\" id=\"udc0ccbaf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u299d41ad\" id=\"u299d41ad\">通常，在提交整个数据集之前，最好先在较少的数据集示例上运行脚本，以确保一切按预期工作,因为完整数据集的处理可能需要花费几个小时的时间。使用以下参数将数据集截断为最大样本数：</span></p><ul list=\"u8af221f2\"><li fid=\"u9dce14e4\" data-lake-id=\"u6b998e73\" id=\"u6b998e73\"><code data-lake-id=\"uad997b08\" id=\"uad997b08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1997a87c\" id=\"u1997a87c\">max_train_samples</span></code></li><li fid=\"u9dce14e4\" data-lake-id=\"u86bd6dc7\" id=\"u86bd6dc7\"><code data-lake-id=\"u230e8b39\" id=\"u230e8b39\"><span data-lake-id=\"uce54674c\" id=\"uce54674c\">max_eval_samples</span></code></li><li fid=\"u9dce14e4\" data-lake-id=\"u94e4ab84\" id=\"u94e4ab84\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7da21d1a\" id=\"u7da21d1a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06cecd3d\" id=\"u06cecd3d\">max_predict_samples</span></code></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20examples%2Fpytorch%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_train_samples%2050%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_eval_samples%2050%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_predict_samples%2050%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--overwrite_output_dir%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--predict_with_generate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xETZm%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u6bd3559b\" id=\"u6bd3559b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9d4a8f0\" id=\"ua9d4a8f0\">并非所有示例脚本都支持</span><code data-lake-id=\"u64eb79e0\" id=\"u64eb79e0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b01520e\" id=\"u7b01520e\">max_predict_samples</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uec80407c\" id=\"uec80407c\">参数。如果您不确定您的脚本是否支持此参数，请添加</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8dd7f4a6\" id=\"u8dd7f4a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufae944e8\" id=\"ufae944e8\">-h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u28dfc39d\" id=\"u28dfc39d\">参数进行检查：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22examples%2Fpytorch%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%20-h%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S6owt%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"QpVz8\" id=\"QpVz8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3f8e2b7\" id=\"ue3f8e2b7\">从checkpoint恢复训练</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf7db5c49\" id=\"uf7db5c49\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa9cbe9c\" id=\"ufa9cbe9c\">另一个有用的选项是从之前的checkpoint恢复训练。这将确保在训练中断时，您可以从之前停止的地方继续进行，而无需重新开始。有两种方法可以从checkpoint恢复训练。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ube2a2682\" id=\"ube2a2682\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7bd3cec8\" id=\"u7bd3cec8\">第一种方法使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u252a04c6\" id=\"u252a04c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b7970b1\" id=\"u5b7970b1\">output_dir previous_output_dir</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue063d989\" id=\"ue063d989\">参数从存储在</span><code data-lake-id=\"u266ce79b\" id=\"u266ce79b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf403c4a0\" id=\"uf403c4a0\">output_dir</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2b913918\" id=\"u2b913918\">中的最新的checkpoint恢复训练。在这种情况下，您应该删除</span><code data-lake-id=\"u600c9844\" id=\"u600c9844\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua5d50f2c\" id=\"ua5d50f2c\">overwrite_output_dir</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u850879f7\" id=\"u850879f7\">：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20examples%2Fpytorch%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20previous_output_dir%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--predict_with_generate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YTDRg%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u10ded4d4\" id=\"u10ded4d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19819d39\" id=\"u19819d39\">第二种方法使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufd502c4c\" id=\"ufd502c4c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad0ec7d1\" id=\"uad0ec7d1\">resume_from_checkpoint path_to_specific_checkpoint</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4d31a6ab\" id=\"u4d31a6ab\">参数从特定的checkpoint文件夹恢复训练。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20examples%2Fpytorch%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--overwrite_output_dir%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--resume_from_checkpoint%20path_to_specific_checkpoint%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--predict_with_generate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OZLTY%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"OCG3p\" id=\"OCG3p\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubced05ae\" id=\"ubced05ae\">分享模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u602622b0\" id=\"u602622b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u031cd0ba\" id=\"u031cd0ba\">所有脚本都可以将您的最终模型上传到</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/models\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ueb31a025\" id=\"ueb31a025\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5730d818\" id=\"u5730d818\">Model Hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uc373cf73\" id=\"uc373cf73\">。在开始之前，请确保您已登录Hugging Face：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22huggingface-cli%20login%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i8zIZ%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u995abf44\" id=\"u995abf44\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca5aa29a\" id=\"uca5aa29a\">然后，在脚本中添加</span><code data-lake-id=\"u72159c24\" id=\"u72159c24\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef8d6c99\" id=\"uef8d6c99\">push_to_hub</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u771f81b5\" id=\"u771f81b5\">参数。这个参数会创建一个带有您Hugging Face用户名和</span><code data-lake-id=\"u28de4311\" id=\"u28de4311\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6dd0b283\" id=\"u6dd0b283\">output_dir</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u32f50589\" id=\"u32f50589\">中指定的文件夹名称的仓库。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua57bf8ba\" id=\"ua57bf8ba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7f20769\" id=\"ua7f20769\">为了给您的仓库指定一个特定的名称，使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3c175558\" id=\"u3c175558\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0489286\" id=\"ua0489286\">push_to_hub_model_id</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7173a5dd\" id=\"u7173a5dd\">参数来添加它。该仓库将自动列出在您的命名空间下。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6de48c58\" id=\"u6de48c58\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf6d91f03\" id=\"uf6d91f03\">以下示例展示了如何上传具有特定仓库名称的模型：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20examples%2Fpytorch%2Fsummarization%2Frun_summarization.py%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_train%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--do_eval%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_name%20cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset_config%20%5C%223.0.0%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--source_prefix%20%5C%22summarize%3A%20%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--push_to_hub%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--push_to_hub_model_id%20finetuned-t5-cnn_dailymail%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-summarization%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%3D4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--overwrite_output_dir%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--predict_with_generate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vYY5H%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3e49e92f\" id=\"u3e49e92f\"><br></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1865, "description": "示例代码📎pytorch-train.ppt注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压前言本次分享如何在PyTorch和中运行示例摘要训练脚本设置要成功运行示例脚本的最新版本，您必须在新虚拟环境中从源代码安装 🤗 Transformers：git clone https://github.com/...", "updated_at": "2025-04-28T01:38:34.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-28T01:37:37.000Z", "id": 217435895, "status": 1}